ectly calculates the surcharge, adds it to the pack price, and allocates the result across four types. Its imperative presentation is not an own operational account, but first_person is measurement-only.\",\"reusable_content\":true,\"semantic_novelty\":\"APPLIED_REASONING\",\"status\":\"PASS\",\"student_prefix_sha256\":\"319f05669fdcf4508c13d140e8dc201b311cc6cea1059bd5302191a746ff25e7\",\"target_sha256\":\"7ecae74a15f239664172e87e800977351de73b7bf1483bdfe40a456410b30f5a\"}]}"}}
